# ShellCheck configuration for the V2 bash runtime.
#
# SC2034 / SC2153 - the runtime is split into modules, and each module defines
#                   state that the other modules use. ShellCheck analyses one
#                   file at a time and cannot see the cross-module usage.
# SC2088          - the tilde is matched literally to detect "~" paths, so it
#                   must not be expanded by the shell.
# SC2015          - "a && b || die" is the guard idiom used throughout this code.
# SC2004          - "${var}" inside arithmetic expressions is explicit on purpose.
# SC1091          - the modules are sourced through a variable path.
# SC2319          - the test harness shares local variables between helpers.
disable=SC2034
disable=SC2153
disable=SC2088
disable=SC2015
disable=SC2004
disable=SC1091
disable=SC2319
